SUMMARY:○ Long ride 60 km steady\, HR ~140 (150 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 60 km steady\, HR ~140\n\nWeek 1 of 12 - Base\nADMI
 N FIRST: (1) book the certificato medico agonistico - Italy legally requ
 ires an ECG-based sports medical on the FITRI form\, and without it you 
 are not issued a race pack. Schedule by February. (2) Ramp-test FTP on t
 he D100 this week and rescale the sweet-spot watts below - every bike sp
 lit is a guess until you do. (3) RAMADAN starts about Mon 8 Feb and week
 s 4-7 are in Abu Dhabi (22 Feb - 20 Mar)\; weeks 2-7 are built around bo
 th. Swim goes to FOUR short sessions - frequency beats volume\, fatigue 
 compromises motor learning. SESSION COUNT: 3 runs\, 3-4 swims\, 2 bikes\
 , 1 legs\, 6 days with Thursday off. That is ~9-10 h/week\, which is INT
 ERMEDIATE volume - MyProCoach's beginner 70.3 plan averages 7 h. If adhe
 rence slips\, scale to the beginner shape rather than abandoning weeks. 
 CUT ORDER: (1) Monday easy run\, (2) the fourth swim\, (3) Wednesday leg
 s. Never cut the long ride\, the long run\, or below three swims.\n83 da
 ys to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
