SUMMARY:○ BIKE QUALITY 60-75 min
DESCRIPTION:BIKE QUALITY 60-75 min - 3 x 12 min at sweet spot (88-93% FTP
 \, about 132-140 W)\, 5 min easy spin between. Warm up 15 min. The 90 km
  bike is over half of a 70.3 by time and this is the session that builds
  it.\n\nWeek 1 of 12 - Base\nADMIN FIRST: (1) book the certificato medic
 o agonistico - Italy legally requires an ECG-based sports medical on the
  FITRI form\, and without it you are not issued a race pack. Schedule by
  February. (2) Ramp-test FTP on the D100 this week and rescale the sweet
 -spot watts below - every bike split is a guess until you do. (3) RAMADA
 N starts about Mon 8 Feb and weeks 4-7 are in Abu Dhabi (22 Feb - 20 Mar
 )\; weeks 2-7 are built around both. Swim goes to FOUR short sessions - 
 frequency beats volume\, fatigue compromises motor learning. SESSION COU
 NT: 3 runs\, 3-4 swims\, 2 bikes\, 1 legs\, 6 days with Thursday off. Th
 at is ~9-10 h/week\, which is INTERMEDIATE volume - MyProCoach's beginne
 r 70.3 plan averages 7 h. If adherence slips\, scale to the beginner sha
 pe rather than abandoning weeks. CUT ORDER: (1) Monday easy run\, (2) th
 e fourth swim\, (3) Wednesday legs. Never cut the long ride\, the long r
 un\, or below three swims.\n79 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
