BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w2-s0-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270207
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270208
SUMMARY:○ Long ride 65 km steady. Last fed long ride…
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 65 km steady. Last fed long ride before Ramadan - e
 at and drink normally\, 40-60 g carb per hour.\n\nWeek 2 of 12 - Base\nR
 AMADAN STARTS about Mon 8 Feb (the moon sighting can move it a day). Wee
 ks 2-6 follow the fast: hard and long sessions after iftar (light iftar\
 , start 60-90 min later)\, short easy swims only in the last 1-2 hours b
 efore iftar\, nothing hard and nothing over 60 min while fasted. Monday 
 is a full rest day and the Friday zone-2 ride goes. HR runs higher at th
 e same pace when you are dry - run by effort. First brick on Saturday: s
 tart the run within 5 minutes of racking the bike\; the first 10 min fee
 l wrong and it normalises by km 3. Get the bike fit done before Abu Dhab
 i: saddle height and cleat alignment are named ITBS contributors.\n76 da
 ys to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
