SUMMARY:≈ Swim 35 min before iftar
DESCRIPTION:Swim 35 min before iftar - 1200 m continuous\, easy. Tuesday 
 lanes close 16:30\, so 15:45-16:30\; iftar is about 17:45. Fasted: no sp
 rints.\n\nWeek 2 of 12 - Base\nRAMADAN STARTS about Mon 8 Feb (the moon 
 sighting can move it a day). Weeks 2-6 follow the fast: hard and long se
 ssions after iftar (light iftar\, start 60-90 min later)\, short easy sw
 ims only in the last 1-2 hours before iftar\, nothing hard and nothing o
 ver 60 min while fasted. Monday is a full rest day and the Friday zone-2
  ride goes. HR runs higher at the same pace when you are dry - run by ef
 fort. First brick on Saturday: start the run within 5 minutes of racking
  the bike\; the first 10 min feel wrong and it normalises by km 3. Get t
 he bike fit done before Abu Dhabi: saddle height and cleat alignment are
  named ITBS contributors.\n74 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
