 fore iftar\, nothing hard and nothing over 60 min while fasted. Monday i
 s a full rest day and the Friday zone-2 ride goes. HR runs higher at the
  same pace when you are dry - run by effort. First brick on Saturday: st
 art the run within 5 minutes of racking the bike\; the first 10 min feel
  wrong and it normalises by km 3. Get the bike fit done before Abu Dhabi
 : saddle height and cleat alignment are named ITBS contributors.\n71 day
 s to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
