  in February is dark and cold. Fuel 60 g carb per hour from bottles - in
  Ramadan the night rides are where gut training happens.\n\nWeek 3 of 12
  - Base\nBuy the wetsuit now. Buy for BUOYANCY not speed - beginner suit
 s run 5 mm through core/hips/legs\, which directly fixes the sinking-leg
 s problem. Wetsuits give the biggest gain to inefficient low-buoyancy sw
