SUMMARY:○ Easy ride 75 min on the D100 after iftar\, zone 2
DESCRIPTION:Easy ride 75 min on the D100 after iftar\, zone 2. Then box t
 he bike for Monday's flight: pedals and bars off\, rear derailleur prote
 cted\, spare hanger in the box.\n\nWeek 4 of 12 - Build\nABU DHABI from 
 Mon 22 Feb - the flight day is a rest day. Iftar there is about 18:20\, 
 so night sessions start about 19:30. Al Wathba cycle track is floodlit a
 nd open all night\; the sea is 21-23 C. Sea swims only on a lifeguarded 
 beach\, with a tow buoy\, never alone. GUT TRAINING STARTS - 8-12 weeks 
 out is the window. Target 60-70 g carb/h on the bike\, NOT 90: measured 
 exogenous glucose oxidation is 33 g/h under 70 kg vs 45 g/h above it. At
  56 kg your ceiling is genuinely lower. Fuel every session over 75 min\,
  +10-15 g/h every 1-2 weeks\, and use the exact race products (Maurten\,
  Precision PH 1000). In Ramadan the night rides carry it: drink with ift
 ar\, start 60-90 min later\, fuel from the first 20 min.\n62 days to IRO
 NMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
