SUMMARY:◆ Legs
DESCRIPTION:Legs - maintenance + glute-med\, 30 min after iftar. No gym? 
 Bodyweight and band version: split squats\, single-leg RDL\, band walks\
 , calf raises. LOWER-LEG AND FOOT\, about 5 min at the end: tibialis ant
 erior raises 3 x 15-20 (heels on a step\, toes lifting)\, heel walks 2 x
  20 m\, eccentric dorsiflexion 3 x 10 slow against a band\, short-foot h
 olds 3 x 30 s per side\, tennis ball under the arch 60 s. An 8-week RCT 
 in amateur runners raised lactate threshold velocity 5.9% with intrinsic
  foot work - but that was 30 min DAILY\, so treat this as maintaining th
 e tissue that failed on 7 Sep\, not as a 5.9% gain.\n\nWeek 5 of 12 - Bu
 ild\nTRANSITION PRACTICE this week. Measured Venice T1 median is 7:02 an
 d T2 5:21\; p90 is 11:05 and 7:08. A fumbled pair of transitions costs 8
