SUMMARY:○ Long ride 90 km at Al Wathba (205 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 90 km at Al Wathba - full race distance\, fuelling 
 rehearsal 60-70 g carb per hour. Start at first light: March middays get
  close to 30 C.\n\nWeek 7 of 12 - Build\nLast Abu Dhabi week and the fir
 st fully fed one - the big week. You fly home Sat 20 Mar\, so the brick 
 moves to Thursday. TARGET: 1900 m continuous. The cutoff needs only 3:41
 /100 m and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL - breaststroke the whole thing is permitt
 ed\, and you may hold a buoy or kayak to rest provided you make no forwa
 rd progress. Knowing that is what stops the panic that actually causes s
 wim DNFs.\n41 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
