DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270321
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270322
SUMMARY:○ Long ride 100 km steady at IF 0.70 (225 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 100 km steady at IF 0.70\n\nWeek 8 of 12 - Build\nF
 irst week home: Amsterdam is about 15 C colder\, so dress for the 100 km
 \, and if Saturday's flight wrecked your sleep\, ride it Monday. Biggest
  week. Bike pacing: target IF 0.68-0.72\, cap the first 30 min 5 W BELOW
  target. Above 0.80 on a flat course is almost always a bike PB and a ru
 n blow-up. Also: this is a NON-DRAFTING race - 6 bike lengths clear\, pa
 ss within 25 s\, 5-minute penalty box. You ride in groups\; this is a sk
 ill you do not have.\n34 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
