DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270325
SUMMARY:≈ Swim 40 min
DESCRIPTION:Swim 40 min - wetsuit + crowded-lane contact practice\n\nWeek
  8 of 12 - Build\nFirst week home: Amsterdam is about 15 C colder\, so d
 ress for the 100 km\, and if Saturday's flight wrecked your sleep\, ride
  it Monday. Biggest week. Bike pacing: target IF 0.68-0.72\, cap the fir
 st 30 min 5 W BELOW target. Above 0.80 on a flat course is almost always
  a bike PB and a run blow-up. Also: this is a NON-DRAFTING race - 6 bike
  lengths clear\, pass within 25 s\, 5-minute penalty box. You ride in gr
 oups\; this is a skill you do not have.\n31 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-
 Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
