UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w8-s4-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270324
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270325
SUMMARY:◆ Legs
DESCRIPTION:Legs - maintenance LOWER-LEG AND FOOT\, about 5 min at the en
 d: tibialis anterior raises 3 x 15-20 (heels on a step\, toes lifting)\,
  heel walks 2 x 20 m\, eccentric dorsiflexion 3 x 10 slow against a band
 \, short-foot holds 3 x 30 s per side\, tennis ball under the arch 60 s.
  An 8-week RCT in amateur runners raised lactate threshold velocity 5.9%
  with intrinsic foot work - but that was 30 min DAILY\, so treat this as
  maintaining the tissue that failed on 7 Sep\, not as a 5.9% gain.\n\nWe
 ek 8 of 12 - Build\nFirst week home: Amsterdam is about 15 C colder\, so
  dress for the 100 km\, and if Saturday's flight wrecked your sleep\, ri
 de it Monday. Biggest week. Bike pacing: target IF 0.68-0.72\, cap the f
 irst 30 min 5 W BELOW target. Above 0.80 on a flat course is almost alwa
 ys a bike PB and a run blow-up. Also: this is a NON-DRAFTING race - 6 bi
 ke lengths clear\, pass within 25 s\, 5-minute penalty box. You ride in 
 groups\; this is a skill you do not have.\n31 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venic
 e-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
