SUMMARY:○ Long ride 90 km at race effort (200 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 90 km at race effort\n\nWeek 10 of 12 - Peak\nFull 
 dress rehearsal. Run plan is RUN/WALK from km 0\, not as a fallback: 9 m
 in run / 1 min walk blends to ~7:24/km and beats an even-paced blow-up b
 y minutes per km. The course gives you 3 loops x 7.03 km with 9 aid stat
 ions - walk every one\, 5-15 s\, 3-5 good gulps.\n20 days to IRONMAN 70.
 3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
