SUMMARY:○ BIKE QUALITY 60-75 min
DESCRIPTION:BIKE QUALITY 60-75 min - 3 x 12 min at sweet spot (88-93% FTP
 \, about 132-140 W)\, 5 min easy spin between. Warm up 15 min. The 90 km
  bike is over half of a 70.3 by time and this is the session that builds
  it.\n\nWeek 11 of 12 - Taper\nTaper: volume down 30-50%\, intensity ret
 ained\, swim FREQUENCY untouched. Carb load the day before is 8-12 g/kg 
 = 450-670 g - that is a lot of food for 56 kg and it must be rehearsed\,
  not improvised.\n9 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
